## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical producer-side rate limiting, per-topic isolation, and basic backpressure, all at a beginner level but with real constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Per-topic state and ordering guarantees
- Token bucket rate limiting and refill logic
- Backpressure strategies: accept/queue vs reject with retry
